nd{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2{y}_{1}+2{y}_{2} \\\\ 2{y}_{1}+3{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{1}(-2{y}_{1}+2{y}_{2})+{x}_{2}(2{y}_{1}+3{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/state.json" "file_sha256" "3bb1af243bcecbe13d9c5c8e1e68728963196bf144c2474bc3b9639d91f20687"} {"question" "q-93996" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "63ae5446cd981c304159deb63b4bd4953b6eca97263bf349f940f91d83211791"} {"question" "q-93996" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/state.json" "file_sha256" "3bb1af243bcecbe13d9c5c8e1e68728963196bf144c2474bc3b9639d91f20687"} {"question" "q-93996" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}"] ["math" "-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{2}"] ["math" "-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}"] ["math" "2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}"] ["math" "2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/state.json" "file_sha256" "3bb1af243bcecbe13d9c5c8e1e68728963196bf144c2474bc3b9639d91f20687"} {"question" "q-93996" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/state.json" "file_sha256" "3bb1af243bcecbe13d9c5c8e1e68728963196bf144c2474bc3b9639d91f20687"} {"question" "q-94047" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & a \\\\ 0 & b\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe matrix of the bilinear form $B(x,y)=6{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}$ is given above. What is the value of $a+b?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/state.json" "file_sha256" "3bb1af243bcecbe13d9c5c8e1e68728963196bf144c2474bc3b9639d91f20687"} {"question" "q-94047" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Each term ${a}_{ij}{x}_{i}{y}_{j}$ in the expression of the bilinear form corresponds to the entry ${a}_{ij}$ of the matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(x,y) & =6{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2} \\\\  & =6{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+(-2){x}_{1}{y}_{2} \\\\  & +\\,0{x}_{2}{y}_{1}\\,+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, the corresponding matrix of the bilinear form is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-2$ and $b=3.$ Finally, \n\n$$\na+b=(-2)+3=1.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/state.json" "file_sha256" "3bb1af243bcecbe13d9c5c8e1e68728963196bf144c2474bc3b9639d91f20687"} {"question" "q-94047" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043646/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "63ae5446cd981c304159deb63b4bd4953b6eca97263bf349f940f91d83211791"} 